msgid ""
"Reverse charge: In the absence of a written objection within one month of "
"receipt of the invoice, the customer is deemed to acknowledge that they are "
"a taxable person required to file periodic returns. If this condition is not"
" met, the customer will be liable for the payment of the tax, interest, and "
"penalties due in relation to this condition."
msgstr ""
"Prenesenie daňovej povinnosti: Ak zákazník do jedného mesiaca od doručenia "
"faktúry písomne nenamietne, považuje sa za to, že uznáva, že je zdaniteľnou "
"osobou povinnou podávať pravidelné daňové priznania. Ak táto podmienka nie "
"je splnená, zákazník bude povinný zaplatiť daň, úroky a pokuty splatné v "
"súvislosti s touto podmienkou."

